  "snippet": "#​675 — November 25, 2026 Web Version Postgres Weekly Postgres.app 3.0 Brings Easy Postgres 19 to the Mac — If you're not on macOS, keep scrolling, but otherwise this is a neat release of an easy way to run Postgres on t...",
